@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: Marketplace site
	Frontend testing for the Marketplace site

Scenario: View first group of app marketplace pages
	@test.group = "0"
	End users should be able to view the app marketplace pages.

	Given I should be able to view the marketplace page with the relative url "web/marketplace"

Scenario: View second group of app marketplace pages
	@test.group = "1"
	End users should be able to view the app marketplace pages.

	Given I should be able to view the marketplace page with the relative url "web/marketplace?delta=15&start=7"

